>
> "hello wise owl!" said the duckling. "how can i make friends?"
> the owl was very scared. "you're on fire!" the owl swiftly flew away.
>
> the baby ducking took that remark as a compliment. *I AM ON FIRE* the
> baby duckling thought. yes, it is on fire.
>
> the baby duckling went to school the next day feeling better than ever.
> the baby duckling decided the best way to make friends would be to spread
> the joy of being on fire. now it would have all the friends it wanted.
>
> the end.
